{title: 424 - For Thee, O Dear, Dear Country}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Doctrines}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[G/D]For [D/F#]thee, [D7/C]O [Em]dear country,
[D7/C]Mine eyes [Em]their [F#7/E]vigils [D7/F#]keep;
[Bm/F#]For [F#dim]very [Bm]love [Am]beholding
[G]Thy holy [C]name, [Em]they [G/D]weep.

Verse 2:
[G/D]O [D/F#]one, [G/D]O only [Em]mansion!
[D7/C]O Paradise [Em]of [D7/F#]joy!
[Bm/F#]Where [F#dim]tears [Am]are [Bm]ever [D7]banish'd
[G]And smiles [Bm]have [G/D]no [Em]alloy;

Verse 3:
[G/D]With [D/F#]jasper [G]glow [Em]thy burwarks,
[D7/C]Thy streets [Em]with [F#]emeralds [D7/F#]blaze;
[Bm/F#]The [F#dim]sardius [Bm]and [Am]the [D7]topaz
[G]Unite [Em/B]in [C]thee [Em]their [G/D]rays;

Verse 4:
[G/D]The [D/F#]cross [G/D]is all [Em]thy splendor,
[D7/C]The [G]Crucified [Em]thy [D7/F#]praise;
[Bm/F#]His [F#dim]laud [Am]and [Bm]benediction
[G]Thy ransom'd [C]saints [Em]shall [G/D]raise;

Verse 5:
[G/D]O [D/F#]sweet [D7/C]and [Em]blessed country,
[D7/C]The home [Em]of [F#7/E]God's [Em]elect!
[Bm/F#]O [F#dim]sweet [Am]and blessed [D7/F#]country
[G]That eager [C]hearts [Em]expect!
